# Keep the working copy byte-identical to what the formatter expects.
#
# The packages are formatted with LF, and `core.autocrlf=true` — the setting Git
# for Windows offers on install — rewrites every text file to CRLF on checkout.
# Biome then reports a format diagnostic for each file, and because it stops
# after twenty diagnostics those line endings hide the findings that matter:
# the last run on such a checkout showed 611 errors, of which 483 were line
# endings and 128 were imports that had drifted from `biome.json`.
#
# Declaring the line endings overrides `core.autocrlf`, so a checkout looks the
# same on every platform and `pnpm check` says the same thing everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
